# artifacts
__pycache__
.pytest*
*.egg-info
*/build/*
*/dist/*


# Generated agent context. `.agents/summary/*` was committed once and then
# described version 0.9.81 for six months, with a directory tree predating
# host.py and coordinator.py. A generated summary with no regeneration step is
# worse than none, because a reader cannot tell stale from current. The
# agent-facing source of truth is AGENTS.md, with CONTRIBUTING.md beside it.
# Only summary/ is ignored, so hand-written agent config under .agents/ can
# still be committed.
.agents/summary/

